      "notes": "You are a task extraction bot. Extract 2-3 subtasks from the text below.\n\nCRITICAL RULES:\n1. Return ONLY valid JSON\n2. NO explanations\n3. NO markdown\n4. NO other text\n\nRequired format:\n{\"subtasks\": [{\"title\": \"First task\"}, {\"title\": \"Second task\"}]}\n\nText to analyze:"
